Project Context: We are building an AI Travel Planner mobile app.
Frontend: React Native (Expo) + NativeWind (Tailwind).
Backend: Python 3 + FastAPI + SQLite (Running in Docker).
AI: Ollama (Llama 3 and Phi-3).

Critical Architecture Rules:
1. ALWAYS use the Singleton Design Pattern for the SQLite database connection.
2. ALWAYS use the Repository Design Pattern for database queries.
3. ALWAYS use the Factory Design Pattern to instantiate the AI Agents.
4. For frontend styling, ALWAYS use NativeWind (Tailwind classes). Do not use React Native StyleSheet unless absolutely necessary.